Rex native client hosts

Chezmoi adds missing native GUI hosts through the verified build-{{ .rex.mac_app.build }} format.
Existing hosts and custom names are preserved. No app restart is automatic.
If new hosts are not visible in Ctrl-a g, a user-approved app relaunch may be needed.

Press Ctrl-a, release it, then press g to switch hosts.
Ctrl-a followed by s opens the selected host's sessions.
Cmd-Shift-P opens the native command palette.

Configured labels and literal addresses:
